<item><title>Senegal’s parliament rejects decree imposing revised 2026 budget</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-parliament-rejects-decree-imposing-revised-2026-8be0b5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-parliament-rejects-decree-imposing-revised-2026-8be0b5/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The assembly adopted its resolution by 128 votes to nine, warning officials against implementing a budget it considers unconstitutional and illegal.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:09:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-parliament-rejects-decree-imposing-revised-2026-8be0b5/share.jpg" length="43428" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-parliament-rejects-decree-imposing-revised-2026-8be0b5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
